  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmentally friendly stone and marble</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partners have identified the need for a more environment friendly marble production in the Palestinian Territories. With this project, they want to introduce machines that decrease the waste of the marble production process considerably and also recycling of process water will be installed.The applicant is Technical Tasks for Trade &amp; Contracting Ltd., a contractor and trader for marble and stone in Qatar. The local partner is Jerusalem Marble and Stones Investment Co., owner of two quarries for marble and a facility to process the marble.The project will be an example for the colleague producers of marble on environmental friendly production.</narrative>
  </description>
